Server init.
>> a := Blob bago: 4.
a bytes: ( Listahan bago ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob bago: 4.
b bytes: ( Listahan bago ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a bago.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Labas isulat: ( a ^ c ), bagong-linya. } saluhin: { :e Labas isulat: e, bagong-linya. }, patakbuhin.
a palayain.
b palayain.
